:240.125,"e":240.445},{"w":"day","s":240.445,"e":240.685},{"w":"is","s":240.685,"e":240.925},{"w":"presenting","s":240.925,"e":241.485},{"w":"the","s":241.485,"e":241.645},{"w":"bill.","s":241.645,"e":242.205}]},{"speaker":"Sunnie","start":242.76,"end":252.84,"text":"Ouch. Okay. But here's my counterargument: those stolen hours feel amazing. In the moment, it genuinely feels like winning.","words":[{"w":"Ouch.","s":242.765,"e":243.565},{"w":"Okay.","s":243.885,"e":244.525},{"w":"But","s":244.605,"e":244.925},{"w":"here's","s":244.925,"e":245.405},{"w":"my","s":245.405,"e":245.645},{"w":"counterargument:","s":245.645,"e":246.685},{"w":"those","s":246.765,"e":247.085},{"w":"stolen","s":247.085,"e":247.565},{"w":"hours","s":247.565,"e":247.965},{"w":"feel","s":247.965,"e":248.285},{"w":"amazing.","s":248.285,"e":248.925},{"w":"In","s":249.245,"e":249.485},{"w":"the","s":249.485,"e":249.645},{"w":"moment,","s":249.645,"e":250.205},{"w":"it","s":250.285,"e":250.525},{"w":"genuinely","s":250.525,"e":251.245},{"w":"feels","s":251.245,"e":251.645},{"w":"like","s":251.645,"e":251.885},{"w":"winning.","s":251.885,"e":252.285}]},{"speaker":"Declan","start":253.14,"end":262.5,"text":"Of course it does. But it backfires. You steal from sleep to feel free, and the exhaustion makes tomorrow even less yours.","words":[{"w":"Of","s":253.2,"e":253.52},{"w":"course","s":253.52,"e":253.84},{"w":"it","s":253.84,"e":253.92},{"w":"does.","s":253.92,"e":254.48},{"w":"But","s":254.8,"e":255.12},{"w":"it","s":255.12,"e":255.52},{"w":"backfires.","s":255.52,"e":256.56},{"w":"You","s":256.8,"e":257.04},{"w":"steal","s":257.04,"e":257.36},{"w":"from","s":257.36,"e":257.6},{"w":"sleep","s":257.6,"e":258},{"w":"to","s":258,"e":258.32},{"w":"feel","s":258.32,"e":258.56},{"w":"free,","s":258.56,"e":259.12},{"w":"and","s":259.2,"e":259.36},{"w":"the","s":259.36,"e":259.52},{"w":"exhaustion","s":259.52,"e":260.08},{"w":"makes","s":260.08,"e":260.4},{"w":"tomorrow","s":260.4,"e":260.96},{"w":"even","s